WEBVTT

00:16:59.969 --> 00:17:01.897
(Music fades out)

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.526
Felicia Shafiq: I hadn't played
volleyball or really any sports

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.816
before I got to SAP.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.566
AG: That's Felicia Shafiq,

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.656
she's a product support manager.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.783
She's pretty tall,
so when she started in 2005,

00:17:18.807 --> 00:17:22.296
her coworkers recruited her
to join their SAP volleyball league.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.816
FS: It was all paid for,
so why not, right?

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:27.790
That's how it all started,
and I fell in love with the sport.

00:17:27.814 --> 00:17:30.796
AG: Many leaders fear that hobbies
are a distraction from work,